XTouch Boombox v2.0.0-beta
ESP32-2432S028R DIY Boombox Edition

Release Features:
- Converted 3D printer interface to boombox UI
- 10-band graphic equalizer (60Hz-16kHz)
- Bluetooth A2DP audio support
- Spotify Connect integration
- Comprehensive settings UI
- Web demo for testing without hardware
- WIHZI ZK-1001B amplifier integration
- Brightness control with slider
- EQ presets (Flat, Rock, Pop, Jazz)
- Real-time spectrum analyzer visualization

Build Date: 2025-08-20
Hardware Target: ESP32-2432S028R (Cheap Yellow Display)
Amplifier: WIHZI ZK-1001B (TPA3116D2 100W)
Display: ILI9341 320x240 TFT (Landscape mode)

Dependencies:
- LVGL 8.3.9 for ESP32 UI
- ESP32-A2DP for Bluetooth audio
- TFT_eSPI for display driver
- XPT2046_Touchscreen for touch input
- ESPAsyncWebServer for Spotify OAuth
- ArduinoJSON for configuration

Development Status: Beta
- Core functionality implemented
- Web demo fully functional with 10-band EQ
- ESP32 firmware compilation in progress
- JavaScript EQ TypeError fixed
- All major features tested in simulator

Known Issues:
- ESP32 firmware build requires dependency cleanup
- Touch pin not configured (warning only)
- MQTT/3D printer dependencies commented out for boombox build